Don't carry spellbook - put them in your stash.  You do not want
to destroy them because high level characters can cast spells
better than low level characters.

> I'm not expert, restricted means I will never be able to use it, right?

Restricted means you can not improve in that school with practice.
You can still get better at those spells as your XP level goes higher,
and you can select specific armor types to improve your chances.

A carefully kitted out Valk at XP=30 has about a 60% failure rate
at Identify spell.  For Identify that's good enough.  For Attack school
spells high failure rates are NOT good enough.  When you are
facing an advancing halfneshee you do not want to waste a turn on
a failed spell.



